        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "1) Revel in the Charm of an Oriental Café"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Immerse yourself in the quintessential Egyptian experience at a traditional Oriental café. These cultural havens, scattered across Egypt, are the perfect retreat to unwind after a day of exploration. Among the must-visit destinations is the iconic "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "Khan El-Khalili Bazaar"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Here, amidst the labyrinth of shopping delights, you can savor the flavors of Egypt with a steaming cup of mint tea or a richly aromatic coffee. For those inclined, partaking in a session of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000008"
              ],
              "text": "shisha"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " – the traditional flavored tobacco pipe – offers a taste of local leisure. These cafés, more than mere eateries, are gateways to Egyptian culture and camaraderie."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/cairo-travel-guide/khan-al-khalili-bazaar/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/cairo/khan-al-khalili-bazaar",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://www.hookah-shisha.com/c-3-hookah-tobacco-shisha-tobacco.html",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "2) Discover the Ancient Nilometer"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Journey back in time at the historic"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000f"
              ],
              "text": " Nilometer"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", a remarkable testament to Egypt’s ancient ingenuity. Constructed in 861 AD, this architectural marvel was crucial in measuring the ebb and flow of the Nile. The Nilometer’s readings were pivotal for predicting harvests and floods, shaping the life along the river. Visitors can descend a steep staircase to witness this ancient tool, still nestled at the river’s edge, and feel the pulse of centuries-old Egyptian civilization."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nilometer",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "3) Ascend the Tower of Cairo"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Soar above the city’s horizon at the Tower of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000016"
              ],
              "text": "Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", Egypt’s majestic beacon and a rival in fame only to the great "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000019"
              ],
              "text": "pyramids."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Erected in 1961, this lotus-shaped tower stands as a symbol of modern Egyptian identity. From its heights, one can gaze over Cairo’s sprawling expanse, with the most breathtaking views emerging in the clear late morning or during the serene evenings. While the elevator ride to the top can be bustling, the journey is worth it. At the Sky Garden Café, refreshments are modestly priced, offering a casual setting just below the observatory. For a more luxurious experience, the tower’s revolving restaurant provides an exquisite dining affair with panoramic views."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/tours-by-location/cairo/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/cairo",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/pyramids-of-giza-sphinx-egyptian-museum-khan-el-khalili-tour/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/private-tour-pyramids-of-giza-sphinx-egyptian-museum-and-khan-el-khalili-bazaar",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "4) Glide Along the Nile in a Nile Taxi"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Experience Cairo from a unique perspective with a ride on the Nile Taxi. Whether you opt for a pre-chartered journey, join the bustling common lines, or choose a tourist-focused trip, the Nile Taxi offers an unparalleled view of the city from its lifeblood, the River Nile. Alongside these taxis, boats ply the waters, allowing for an intimate exploration of the Nile’s timeless beauty."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Each of these experiences in Cairo weaves together the rich tapestry of Egypt’s past and present, inviting travelers to partake in the city’s enduring allure."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
